  "comment": "There might be a problem with your USB device vender id. Try different device ids as available in Android documentation ( http://developer.android.com/tools/device.html ). Many devices are recognized using Google (18d1). All other things are simple. Just Create a file: sudo gedit /etc/udev/rules.d/51-android.rules and add: SUBSYSTEM==\"usb\", ATTR{idVendor}==\"18d1\", MODE=\"0666\", GROUP=\"plugdev\"",
